# nexora-action-code: get_memory
Value Filldown TOTAL_MEMORY (\d+)
Value Filldown USED_MEMORY (\d+)
Value Filldown FREE_MEMORY (\d+)
Value Filldown AVAILABLE_MEMORY (\d+)
Value Filldown USED_PERCENT (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value Filldown FREE_PERCENT (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value Filldown SWAP_TOTAL (\d+)
Value Filldown SWAP_FREE (\d+)
Value Filldown ACTIVE_MEMORY (\d+)
Value Filldown INACTIVE_MEMORY (\d+)
Value Filldown MAPPED_MEMORY (\d+)
Value Filldown SLAB_MEMORY (\d+)
Value Filldown OTHERS_MEMORY (\d+)
Value List PID (\d+)
Value List VSD (\d+)
Value List TEXT (\d+)
Value List RSS (\d+)
Value List DATA (\d+)
Value List STACK (\d+)
Value List PROC_TOTAL (\d+)
Value List PROCESS (\S+)

Start
  ^.*#\s*show\s+ -> Next
  # Format 1 (New RGOS / Single-line system summary)
  ^\s*System\s+[Mm]emory:\s*${TOTAL_MEMORY}\s*KB\s+total,\s*${USED_MEMORY}\s*KB\s+used,\s*${FREE_MEMORY}\s*KB\s+free,\s*${AVAILABLE_MEMORY}\s*KB\s+available,\s*${USED_PERCENT}%\s+used\s+rate
  # Format 2 (Legacy summary format)
  ^\s*Total\s+memory:\s*${TOTAL_MEMORY}\s*KB,\s*Used\s+memory:\s*${USED_MEMORY}\s*KB\s*\(${USED_PERCENT}%\),\s*Free\s+memory:\s*${FREE_MEMORY}\s*KB\s*\(${FREE_PERCENT}%\)
  ^Swap:\s*${SWAP_TOTAL}\s*KB\s+total,\s*${SWAP_FREE}\s*KB\s+free
  ^Used\s+detail:\s*${ACTIVE_MEMORY}\s*KB\s+active,\s*${INACTIVE_MEMORY}\s*KB\s+inactive,\s*${MAPPED_MEMORY}\s*KB\s+mapped,\s*${SLAB_MEMORY}\s*KB\s+slab,\s*${OTHERS_MEMORY}\s*KB\s+others
  ^PID\s+Vsd\s+Text\s+Rss\s+Data\s+Stack\s+Total\s+Process -> ProcessTable
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Next

ProcessTable
  ^\s*${PID}\s+${VSD}\s+${TEXT}\s+${RSS}\s+${DATA}\s+${STACK}\s+${PROC_TOTAL}\s+${PROCESS}\s*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Next
